                        "glosses": [
                            "Too long; overly long."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e278cb4-d12d-40db-bcc6-6871e0037f0a",
                                "sense_id": "152d21b4-0942-372b-8915-d2d79fb9577e",
                                "text": "O, hold me not with silence over-long!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a6a2f87-9484-4e49-ad2a-8e262bfbfb1f",
                                "sense_id": "152d21b4-0942-372b-8915-d2d79fb9577e",
                                "text": "As the Island Mindanao lies very convenient for Trade, so considering its distance, the way thither may not be over long and tiresome."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8817e23-6516-4363-a7c0-08c65ac21119",
                                "sense_id": "152d21b4-0942-372b-8915-d2d79fb9577e",
                                "text": "Many of the adults had been little apes during his boyhood. He had frolicked and played about this very jungle with them during their brief childhood. He wondered if they would remember him—the memory of some apes is not overlong, and two years may be an eternity to them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a435f748-90fc-432b-95d5-b04a7a70a198",
                                "sense_id": "152d21b4-0942-372b-8915-d2d79fb9577e",
                                "text": "So far as this particular service is concerned, there is an overlong interval between the arrival of the car-ferry in Calais at 3.45 p.m. and the departure of the Lyss train from Calais Ville at 6.30 p.m."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5ae3686-333d-496f-946a-5e47577bf8ce",
                                "sense_id": "152d21b4-0942-372b-8915-d2d79fb9577e",
                                "text": "The next minute the little boy, still in his overlong trousers, was being dragged out of the house by the warden who had him by the ear."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
